# .clinerules — gizzradio

## WHO'S WHO
I direct the work; you implement. I do not hand-write code. Explain your plan in plain
language and wait for my approval before changing anything.

## PROJECT
gizzradio.live — a non-commercial, fan-run online radio station for King Gizzard & The
Lizard Wizard fans, built on the band's official Bootlegger program (non-commercial fan use).
This repo is the FRONTEND ONLY: one static page (index.html) with inline <style> and
<script>. No framework, no bundler, no package.json, no build step.
Hosted on GitHub Pages with the custom domain gizzradio.live. main = production.

