## WORKING RULES
- Never run destructive commands (rm, rm -rf, sudo, chmod, mv on tracked files).
- Never read or write outside this workspace.
- Never commit or push. Never touch main. I review, commit, and merge myself.
- One change at a time; keep diffs small enough to review.
- Prefer editing existing blocks over restructuring.
- No new frameworks, build steps, dependencies, npm tooling, or CDN scripts without
  asking first and explaining the trade-off. This project deliberately has none.
- Don't assume something exists (file, setting, config). Check, or ask. Mark uncertainty
  explicitly and never claim something works without evidence — write "unverified" instead.
